  {
   "text": "Forty degrees, so Jess wore her heavy winter coat.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.239
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten minutes uphill, she was soaked in sweat.",
   "start": 3.439,
   "end": 5.781
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule for forty degrees: wool or synthetic base layer, light fleece, wind shell.",
   "start": 6.081,
   "end": 11.386
  },
  {
   "text": "Hat and thin gloves too.",
   "start": 11.536,
   "end": 12.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for your next cold hike.",
   "start": 13.3,
   "end": 15.047
  }
